  <item>
    <title>年终5A魔A｜一个“骨折断手”一个“反复烂脸”2025我们也在用力地活卓</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695a88036d3ad49786c5f2ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695a88036d3ad49786c5f2ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Jan 2026 15:41:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69540f822db086f897e54380" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69540f822db086f897e54380"><span>第一期</span></a><span>，我们从圣诞冬至看到大家在隆重的仪式感中感叹，也许低能量也是对自己精神的一种保护。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6956620b14db1df9efeac17d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6956620b14db1df9efeac17d"><span>第二期</span></a><span>，我们回答了没有仪式感依然可以把生活过得”刻骨铭心“，今年我们的主题是”运动“。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6957efdd2db086f897581f4d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6957efdd2db086f897581f4d"><span>第三期</span></a><span>，所以在生活中遇到一些不大不小，而记忆犹新的时刻，我们都好好地记住了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，2025年终播客最后一期了，病痛不少，但我们总体安好，祝福大家也是！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 喜提甲流猛嗑特效药，感叹科技让生活更美好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 骨折绑完石膏，那味道真的让一部份人欢喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> 我一个年轻大小伙竟然可能确诊干燥综合征，太岁是这么犯的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">05:36</a> 下巴痘用尽一生一世也没有把皮肤养好，难得长痘就要大喊烂脸的人闭嘴好吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> 我终于介入了一段Open Relationship</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> 突然大聊焦虑？！通勤距离增加、一事无成的30代…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 发现我们都是不会“商量”的人，只要对方没有意愿，我们就打退堂鼓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> 装修工人在厕所席地而睡、厕所烧饭，大家都在用力地活着..</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62719909c18a907097560271/lkpP53NW_3bCsaPbmlEcxFQVQzAO.m4a" length="27390628" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:28:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkrK7tRTbc2yYJ0iHmbdovl8N_GL.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>年终5A魔A｜2025我可以为了停车去打市民热线，但无法忍受早上六点的“警报声”！我是去旅行不是去逃难诶！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6957efdd2db086f897581f4d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6957efdd2db086f897581f4d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 17:20:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025年一眨眼就要结束了，以为年末大家都带着摸鱼的心情上班，殊不知每一次都是这么匆匆忙忙，所以这次的年终播客我会拆成好几段发布。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们第一集聊到了</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69540f822db086f897e54380" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69540f822db086f897e54380"><span>2025精神阳痿也是一种能量的保护</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>在第二集</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6956620b14db1df9efeac17d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6956620b14db1df9efeac17d"><span>回顾了运动中收获了长久的满足感</span></a><span>，体脂和班味都byebye</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年也有好多做了就是做了的时刻：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 同一天我提Mini Cooper 月半提Airpods pro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 今年把刚换的蔚来卖了！换成了MiniCooper是因为…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> 物业不作为，我直接拍下证据投诉到随申办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">05:46</a> 今年超巨大的消费：我翻新了我家卫生间 全程哄人式沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">08:32</a> 小夫控诉：月半你是设计师诶，这点比例不同你看不出来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a> 亲眼目睹民风彪悍的武汉司机，直接开干龟速车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 一个警报闹钟，一个鼾声如雷，我们差点拉黑彼此</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> 在名古屋我为了第一个坐上机场快线，被乘务员赶下来</span></p>]]></description>
