  <item>
    <title>年终5A魔A｜2025从运动中收获长久的满足感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6956620b14db1df9efeac17d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6956620b14db1df9efeac17d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 12:04:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025年一眨眼就要结束了，以为年末大家都带着摸鱼的心情上班，殊不知每一次都是这么匆匆忙忙，所以这次的年终播客我会拆成好几段发布。</span></p><span></span><p><span>上一集：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69540f822db086f897e54380" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69540f822db086f897e54380"><span>2025精神阳痿也是一种能量的保护</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>我们提到了节日的仪式感，而比起仪式感带来的快乐，我们今年各自选择了不同的运动，累并快乐着。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> 月半的年度总结：选择痛苦地练、轻松地活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">01:29</a> 成功减肥秘诀：就是坚持“管住嘴、迈开腿”这句正确的废话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="353">05:53</a> 小夫的年度壮举：终于开始学游泳，还学了自由泳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a> 年度大冤种：斥巨资60元在更衣室洗了个“天价澡”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a> 泳池领地之争：练打腿被上海老头要求去其他泳道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 泳池见闻：游深水区竟然要我当场考试诶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a> 泳池生物多样性：遇见皮肤病老头、灰指甲消防员。个人卫生要注意馁～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> 今年放弃高贵的网球转战羽毛球，月半惊呼自己在场上像一个肉装坦克</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 菜就是原罪</span><strong><span>，</span></strong><span>球技如果悬殊太多就会招来嫌弃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 羽毛球简直像一种冥想，帮我专注当下，狠狠拍走班味</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62719909c18a907097560271/lsmKclZwvozazxGq4Bl0CaPsiM-0.m4a" length="19567704" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:20:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkrK7tRTbc2yYJ0iHmbdovl8N_GL.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
