    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpJ4JFJvk3Iu3AnD4DH4En3prgrB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>笑死 标题其实是沿用了林依晨名人名言，很好地概括了我和🦐🗡️货</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6725e0c0ba0cbaec01ac1b04" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6725e0c0ba0cbaec01ac1b04"><span>@女大（播客SION想）</span></a><span> 的🦐🗡️心理，来听听当事人的声音，好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> 为爱罚抄10遍文言文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">3:29</a> 把笔名改成暗恋帅哥的名字，好让他拆开我的信件<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">05:12</a> 爱他就让他全班都分数名列前茅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 数学默写公式的特别优待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">08:34</a> 为了偶遇他连续吃了一周KFC</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 为了让他打篮球有面儿，我送完AJ才发现他爱的是她</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 拿出一半生活费送他礼物只收到谢谢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 白嫖我的面膜还不肯帮我买欢乐谷门票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> 冬天上海街边等待“错的人”的4小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 花钱、赔本赚友谊</span></p>]]></description>
